# Camera and drone originals. This one is 180 MB and GitHub hard-refuses
# anything over 100 MB, so the push would fail. The web-ready encode in
# public/theme is what the site ships; keep originals in your own backup.
assets-source/*.mp4
assets-source/*.MP4
assets-source/*.mov
assets-source/*.MOV
